{"text": " So in the early days of sales, I remember this guy walked in. He's got paint splattered all over him. And I was like, what is going on here? I'm here trying to sell this guy weight loss. And I really needed the sale. And so I gave it my all. I remember asking him, I was like, oh, so what do you do? And he was a business owner that owned a bunch of stuff. And the guy ended up buying my most expensive thing. I remember when he walked out the door, I made a promise to myself that I would always treat people with the respect that they would buy. Because you just don't know what someone has in their wallet based on what they wear.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 2.2, "text": " So in the early days of sales, I remember this guy walked in.", "tokens": [50364, 407, 294, 264, 2440, 1708, 295, 5763, 11, 286, 1604, 341, 2146, 7628, 294, 13, 50474], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1164822356645451, "compression_ratio": 1.772594752186589, "no_speech_prob": 0.002932811388745904}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 2.2, "end": 3.92, "text": " He's got paint splattered all over him.", "tokens": [50474, 634, 311, 658, 4225, 4732, 13939, 439, 670, 796, 13, 50560], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1164822356645451, "compression_ratio": 1.772594752186589, "no_speech_prob": 0.002932811388745904}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 3.92, "end": 5.16, "text": " And I was like, what is going on here?", "tokens": [50560, 400, 286, 390, 411, 11, 437, 307, 516, 322, 510, 30, 50622], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1164822356645451, "compression_ratio": 1.772594752186589, "no_speech_prob": 0.002932811388745904}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 5.16, "end": 7.0, "text": " I'm here trying to sell this guy weight loss.", "tokens": [50622, 286, 478, 510, 1382, 281, 3607, 341, 2146, 3364, 4470, 13, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.1164822356645451, "compression_ratio": 1.772594752186589, "no_speech_prob": 0.002932811388745904}, {"id": 4, "seek":